o the human race\n\nPart 11:\nA celebration, Mr. Blue Sky's up there waitin'\nAnd today is the day we've waited for\n\nPart 12:\nOh, Mr. Blue Sky, please tell us why\nYou had to hide away for so long (so long)\n\nPart 13:\nWhere did we go wrong?\n\nPart 14:\nHey there, Mr. Blue\nWe're so pleased to be with you\n\nPart 15:\nLook around, see what you do\nEverybody smiles at you\n\nPart 16:\nHey there, Mr. Blue\n\nPart 17:\nWe're so pleased to be with you\nLook around, see what you do\nEverybody smiles at you\n\nPart 18:\n(Instrumental thing)\n\nPart 19:\nMr. Blue, you did it right\n\nPart 20:\nBut soon comes Mr. Night creepin' over\nNow his hand is on your shoulder\n\nPart 21:\nNever mind, I'll remember you this\nI'll remember you this way\n\nPart 22:\nMr. Blue Sky, please tell us why\nYou had to hide away for so long (so long)\nWhere did we go wrong?\n\nPart 23: \nHey there Mr. Blue (sky)\nWe're so pleased to be with you (sky)\n\nPart 24:\nLook around see what you do (blue)\nEverybody smiles at you\n\nPart 25-Outro:\n(Instrumental)"}},"currentCostume":0,"costumes":[{"name":"backdrop1","bitmapResolution":1,"dataFormat":"svg","assetId":"672cae9b7f3dbf3f6f6311e03031b1f7","md5ext":"672cae9b7f3dbf3f6f6311e03031b1f7.svg","rotationCenterX":59.762730227518944,"rotationCenterY":27.626528764897046},{"name":"backdrop2","bitmapResolution":1,"dataFormat":"svg","assetId":"d97e83b7bc21bd0e9e01bb06f68ccc44","md5ext":"d97e83b7bc21bd0e9e01bb06f68ccc44.svg","rotationCenterX":59.762730227518944,"rotationCenterY":27.626528764897046},{"name":"backdrop3","bitmapResolution":1,"dataFormat":"svg","assetId":"1859f676f15172e4ac5b7d98e255e7fa","md5ext":"1859f676f15172e4ac5b7d98e255e7fa.svg","rotationCenterX":62.730705312499964,"rotationCenterY":28.590269481201176},{"name":"backdrop4","bitmapResolution":1,"dataFormat":"svg","assetId":"5de8dc4903ebe20b604b7c69073004d7","md5ext":"5de8dc4903ebe20b604b7c69073004d7.svg","rotationCenterX":62.730705312499964,"rotationCenterY":28.590269481201176},{"name"